silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#shapeset_s a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.01_signature_calculus.sections.08_sigma_enc_as_container.concrete_anchor#shapeset_s" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#shapeset_s silm:hasLongDescription "The ShapeSet_S is ShapeSet_S: the concrete shape set S = {ingest, type, validate, render} of the Tartu Animal Clinic encyclopedia publication pipeline; each element is a named publish operation; the four shapes that label the nodes of a PublishTreeType tree." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#positionfamily_p a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.01_signature_calculus.sections.08_sigma_enc_as_container.concrete_anchor#positionfamily_p" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#positionfamily_p silm:hasLongDescription "The PositionFamily_P is PositionFamily_P: the uniform position family P: S -> Set with P(s) = {*} for all s; every publish operation takes exactly one argument (arity 1); this makes the container linear and Sigma(X) = S x X rather than an exponential." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#containerfunctor_sigma a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.01_signature_calculus.sections.08_sigma_enc_as_container.concrete_anchor#containerfunctor_sigma" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor#containerfunctor_sigma silm:hasLongDescription "The ContainerFunctor_Sigma is ContainerFunctor_Sigma: the publish-signature functor as container T(S lhd P)(X) = Sum_{s in S} X^{P(s)} = S x X; isomorphic to the polynomial Sigma(X) = ingest(X) + type(X) + validate(X) + render(X); applied to VetRecord_77 yields four publish-tagged copies." .
